r, or Jack cheese. The burger is delicious. The fried here are fatter than McDonald's or other fast food so it has nice texture when you take your food to go back to SB. I like how the employee provided some suggestions when I asked what was good.  I was recommended carnitas nachos but I opted for chicken. I wish I grabbed some salsa from the salsa bar.... bit the nachos came with one sour cream and one guacamole container. The nachos were a little salty compared to what I normally eat but I'm the flavor was good and had a nice lemon/lime flavor to the chicken. If you come by...I recommend trying out the burgers and maybe a pitcher of beer- I would have ordered it, but don't think they do it to go."}],"state":"CA"}","answer":"Cal Taco is a local business located at 7320 Hollister Ave, Ste 1 in Goleta, CA. The restaurant offers a variety of cuisines, including Burgers, Cafes, Restaurants, Mexican, and American (Traditional). It operates from Tuesday to Sunday, from 8:00 AM to 8:30 PM. The business has parking available in a lot, and it also provides outdoor seating. However, there is no WiFi available at the restaurant.

Customers have given Cal Taco an average rating of 4.0 stars. One recent review mentioned a negative experience with a rude employee who took the phone order and made mistakes with the food order and the bill. Another review highlighted the delicious adobado burrito and tacos, praising the decent prices and generous portions. Additionally, customers appreciate the burgers offered at Cal Taco, with the option to choose from American, cheddar, or Jack cheese. The fries are described as having a nice texture compared to other fast food options.

